  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Panno School Ukraine, Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Panno School is an innovative, modular, and sustainable school building concept designed specifically for Ukraine&#x2019;s urgent educational infrastructure needs post-conflict. The project aims to deliver scalable, flexible, and contextually adapted school modules based on the 3Cycle open-source modular construction system. The first phase concentrated on pilot design and feasibility, while Phase 02 focuses on prototyping, refining the modular system, and preparing forscalable production and implementation across multiple Ukrainian regions. In Phase 01 and Phase 02 we focused on the first and most needed product of the Panno School concept; the Kindergarten&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
